webm?t=1671894540\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2249800/extras/347524a381a879bef7d563bdfad0c034.mp4?t=1671894540\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Once a month you will analyze your progress, see projects that succeeded or failed, prepare your strategy for the next month, upgrade your office, or if you can't afford, just your equipment, hire or fire employees, and if you really hit the jackpot, even buying a supercar or a vacation, the choice is yours!<br><br><strong>Only you can change your future! Wishlist now!</strong>",
